). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":2354,"global_rank":77618,"final_score":2354,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":13340},{"name":"yoyokazoo/MagicArtDownloader","owner":"yoyokazoo","html_url":"https://github.com/yoyokazoo/MagicArtDownloader","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Takes a text decklist, downloads/copies local art, spits out images for proxying","topics":[],"score":2354,"global_rank":77626,"final_score":2354,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":13341},{"name":"rey-allan/aguefort","owner":"rey-allan","html_url":"https://github.com/rey-allan/aguefort","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":":game_die: A chatbot for asking about D&D tips powered by Dropout's Adventuring Academy knowledge and LLMs.","topics":["claude-3-haiku","dungeons-and-dragons","faiss","generative-ai","gradio","langchain","large-language-models","rag"],"score":2354,"global_rank":77630,"final_score":2354,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":13342},{"name":"ImmanuelShin/drf-api-permissions-postgres","owner":"ImmanuelShin","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelShin/drf-api-permissions-postgres","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2354,"global_rank":77637,"final_score":2354,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":13343},{"name":"ImmanuelShin/drf-api","owner":"ImmanuelShin","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelShin/drf-api","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","descript